---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About – Stefan Ilić">
  <section class="band" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start">
    <img src="/stefan.jpg" alt="Stefan Ilić" width="200" height="200" style="border-radius:24px;object-fit:cover" />
    <div class="prose" style="flex:1 1 320px">
      <h1 style="margin-top:0">About me</h1>
      <p>I'm a Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central developer based in Serbia. I build reliable, maintainable AL extensions and integrations that support real business processes.</p>
      <p>Over the last four years I've worked for ISVs and partners in Denmark, Germany and the Adriatic region: POS and retail functionality, industry solutions, REST API integrations and legacy NAV 2015 (C/AL). These days AI coding agents are part of my daily AL workflow.</p>
      <p>I'm PL-600 certified (Microsoft Power Platform Solution Architect) and open to new Business Central work, contract or near full-time, remote.</p>
      <p style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
        <a class="btn" href="/Stefan_Ilic_CV.pdf">Download CV (PDF)</a>
        <a class="btn" style="background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/stefan-ili%C4%87/">LinkedIn</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
